    "description": {
      "value": "<p>If you have no uses of Innate Sorcery left, you can use it if you spend 2 Sorcery Points when you take the Bonus Action to activate it.</p><p>In addition, while your Innate Sorcery feature is active, you can use up to two of your Metamagic options on each spell you cast.</p><section id=\"secret-l8yUYHYrWEjQI4Q0\" class=\"secret\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Use this feature to consume 2 Sorcery Points and restore a use of Innate Sorcery.</p></section>",
